<title>USA: Abigail Adams National Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Abigail Adams National Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31, 1997 and 1996 and Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>					 Three Months Ended:</p>
<p>			   3/31/97	    3/31/96	 12/31/96</p>
<p>Net interest income</p>
<p>			 1,295,000	  1,093,000	1,269,000</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses</p>
<p>			    -		    -	     (225,000)</p>
<p>Net interest income after provision for loan losses</p>
<p>			 1,295,000	  1,093,000	1,494,000</p>
<p> Net income	   $249,000	   $238,000	 $344,000</p>
<p>Net income per common</p>
<p>   share		   $0.15		$0.28	    $0.21</p>
<p>NOTE:  Earnings of $0.15 per share for the first quarter of 1997 decreased by $0.13 from the $0.28 per share reported for the same period in 1996 due to the additional 795,500 shares issued in an oversubscribed stock offering completed during the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Abigail Adams National Bancorp Inc.</p>
</text>
